===============================
v0.6.0 - First Stable Version
===============================

Presented by: Nicolas Gracia (nizolax)
Purpose: Present v0.6.0
Pre-release: v0.5.0
Released: v0.6.0

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

In the v0.6.0 was presented the first
stable version of Knight Shell, almost the
errors of v0.3.0 were fixed.

---------
ERRORS
---------

The errors presented in v0.6.0 were:

1. Memory declaration in pointers.
2. Directory commands does not works.
3. Prompts are not personalizable.

------------
FEATURES
------------

The new features presented in v0.6.0, from v0.3.0 are:

1. Raw and Cooked mode created.
2. New DIR structure.
3. Functions recursives.